{"id":"1ff2903ad51947b1","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-topological-algebra.md","title":"thm-topological-algebra","display":"thm-topological-algebra","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-profinite]]","[[93-df-stone-space]]"],"display":"thm-topological-algebra","label":"93-thm-topological-algebra","aliases":["93-thm-topological-algebra"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f5dec406c92aa2e\" href=\"?note=2f5dec406c92aa2e\" title=\"93-df-profinite\">93-df-profinite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a8e20998fad98e\" href=\"?note=d9a8e20998fad98e\" title=\"93-df-stone-space\">93-df-stone-space</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-topological-algebra"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-topological-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-topological-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-topological-algebra-thm-topological-algebra\">thm-topological-algebra <code>thm-topological-algebra</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T\\rangle;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T\\rangle;\\tau)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a8e20998fad98e\" href=\"?note=d9a8e20998fad98e\" title=\"93-df-stone-space\">93-df-stone-space</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2f5dec406c92aa2e\" href=\"?note=2f5dec406c92aa2e\" title=\"93-df-profinite\">93-df-profinite</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}topological\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T\\rangle;\\tau)\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}(|\\mathbf A|,\\mathcal T)\n\\land\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T\\rangle)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}topological\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T\\rangle;\\tau)\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}(|\\mathbf A|,\\mathcal T)\n\\land\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The inverse-limit topology of a profinite algebra is a Stone topology, and all algebraic operations are continuous because they are induced coordinatewise from finite discrete quotients.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-topological-algebra-thm-topological-algebra","text":"thm-topological-algebra `thm-topological-algebra`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-profinite","status":"resolved","id":"2f5dec406c92aa2e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-profinite]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-stone-space","status":"resolved","id":"d9a8e20998fad98e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-stone-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-stone-space","status":"resolved","id":"d9a8e20998fad98e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-stone-space]] and [[93-df-profinite]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-profinite","status":"resolved","id":"2f5dec406c92aa2e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-stone-space]] and [[93-df-profinite]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T\\rangle;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}topological\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T\\rangle;\\tau)\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}(|\\mathbf A|,\\mathcal T)\n\\land\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T\\rangle)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1001,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["2f5dec406c92aa2e","d9a8e20998fad98e"]}